- The call's deadline is set when execute_tool starts (before the KI roots are resolved), held in
  a context variable, and used by list_ki_files / read_ki_file.
- No file-system read starts after the deadline: per-entry looks in a listing ("not checked"
  entries are named and counted), per-sub-folder link checks in walks and counting, the
  start-folder shortcut, the missing-folder and missing-file scans, and a walk never starts late.
- Intake prefix: compared by casefold, cut at the typed slash (STRASSE / Straße kept whole).
- A missing-file answer says when only part of the KI was looked at for similar names.
- Tests: reads counted after the deadline (zero) for listing, missing folder, missing file and
  both searches; ancestor loop stops at once; walk and hidden retry cut at a real point; scoring
  parity with difflib.get_close_matches; Straße.
